{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>For I am dust</b> — Figuratively, like \"He covered me with dust.\" The vav of ושקוי substitutes for the heh, for the letters alef, heh, vav, yod interchange."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 102, :notes {0 "The Hebrew verse cited appears to be הכפישני באפר, which is not a standard biblical verse; rendered the form as it stands."}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:37:46.534559617Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}